      "writtenOn": "2025-04-07T16:29:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should set `fRenderState \u003d renderState` here, as it will always be the same state flags for all later Appenders of the DrawWriter until the next `newPipelineState` call.  Since `flush()` is called at the start, and we\u0027ve already adjusted our pending base, we won\u0027t need the old `fRenderState` value anymore.",
