        "id": 3948337
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-07T17:41:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I haven\u0027t fully worked it out, but my thinking is that for ARM padding the old `fRenderState` will be needed during `reserve()`, because we will need to know if there were instances in the prior append.",
      "parentUuid": "3e901286_b096ca99",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 118,
