      "writtenOn": "2025-04-07T16:29:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should also add an assert here (with the changes I proposed to setTemplate) that `fPendingCount \u003d\u003d 0`.  Currently, the code is flexible enough that if someone had been appending data and then switched to an explicit draw call, it would automatically flush here.\n\nBut realistically, a RenderStep isn\u0027t going to mix appending data and explicit draw calls (and if it were, then it should manually flush). Instead it\u0027ll have been flushed already from the call to newPipelineState, or from the last call to bindAndFlush.",
